Each turn you unleash dark powers through your runeskin.

For each rune you have a random foe in sight will be hit by a spike of decrepitude, dealing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] frostdusk damage.

A foe can only be hit by one spike per turn.

If your life is below 1, the spikes also reduce all damage done by the targets by [5%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 21% (TL1-5)].
